Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Add local RVII environment and WIP tweaks

Nix flake + envrc, run.nu launcher, extra requirements, gpu_profile hook,
noflash_attention import, and debug prints in model loading.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
